  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758880,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1 Year Totally Stoned: A Commodore 64 Classic\n\nPrepare for a mind-bending journey in *1 Year Totally Stoned*, a bizarre and unforgettable adventure for the Commodore 64! You play as a hapless teenager who, through a series of unfortunate events involving a mysterious cake, finds yourself transported one year into the future – a future where everyone is perpetually stoned. \n\nNavigate a surreal, distorted world filled with bizarre characters and nonsensical challenges. The gameplay blends platforming, puzzle-solving, and quirky mini-games, all wrapped in a distinctly psychedelic aesthetic.  Collect strange objects, interact with eccentric NPCs, and unravel the mystery of the cake and its effects on the future. \n\nExpect unpredictable scenarios, laugh-out-loud humor, and a truly unique gaming experience.  *1 Year Totally Stoned* isn't just a game; it's a trip!  Can you restore normalcy to the future and return to your own time, or will you be forever trapped in a haze of baked bliss?"
    },
